WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,120
You just handled it very securely

2
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,860
This sudden poisonous insect bite in the wild

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,500
If you rashly handle it privately

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,100
It is easy to cause secondary poisoning

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:13,340
The consequences are disastrous

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:14,980
Everyone has seen it with their own eyes, right?

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,660
This is the real wild environment

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,580
Just an inconspicuous poisonous insect

9
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,500
A little carelessness can take someone's life

10
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,110
The journey ahead will only become more and more dangerous

11
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,700
Everyone must be alert

12
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:40,930
Be vigilant, get everyone in order, move on, you guys stop first

13
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:42,890
Calculate how much repellent you bring

14
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,130
Follow everyone’s wasteful spraying method now

15
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:49,700
This amount of medicine can't last for three days of field consultation.

16
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:53,950
Do you want to remind other students that there is so much movement?

17
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:55,870
Teacher Hu must have known but didn’t remind him

18
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:57,310
It shows that he has other intentions

19
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,670
We just need to take care of ourselves

20
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:00,540
Can I be your roommate?

21
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:02,540
Definitely since I came to Qingyuan Academy

22
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,580
The luckiest thing I agree with
